{
  "format": 1,
  "name": "tr18_05_water_depth_for_cell",
  "spec": [
    "terrain 10.2",
    "terrain 18.5"
  ],
  "description": "GetWaterDepthForCell: the minimum of the four corner depths if > 0, else 0. (2, 3, 0.5, 4) -> 0.5; (2, -1, 3, 3) -> 0; HasDraftClearance needs > 5.0: (6, 6, 6, 5) -> false, (6, 6, 6, 5.5) -> true. A NaN candidate never replaces the minimum: with the first corner (x, z) at 6 and a NaN elsewhere -> 6.",
  "steps": [
    {
      "op": "ter_create",
      "cells": [
        2,
        2
      ],
      "flat": 300
    },
    {
      "op": "ter_set",
      "cell": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "depths": [
        2,
        3,
        0.5,
        4
      ]
    },
    {
      "op": "ter_call",
      "method": "water_depth_for_cell",
      "args": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "expect": 0.5
    },
    {
      "op": "ter_set",
      "cell": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "depths": [
        2,
        -1,
        3,
        3
      ]
    },
    {
      "op": "ter_call",
      "method": "water_depth_for_cell",
      "args": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "expect": 0
    },
    {
      "op": "ter_set",
      "cell": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "depths": [
        6,
        6,
        6,
        5
      ]
    },
    {
      "op": "ter_call",
      "method": "has_draft_clearance",
      "args": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "expect": false
    },
    {
      "op": "ter_set",
      "cell": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "depths": [
        6,
        6,
        6,
        5.5
      ]
    },
    {
      "op": "ter_call",
      "method": "has_draft_clearance",
      "args": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "expect": true
    },
    {
      "op": "ter_set",
      "cell": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "depths": [
        6,
        "nan",
        7,
        8
      ]
    },
    {
      "op": "ter_call",
      "method": "water_depth_for_cell",
      "args": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "expect": 6
    }
  ]
}
